   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows a shape made from a rectangle and a semicircle.<br>The rectangle measures 12&nbsp;cm by 7&nbsp;cm and the diameter of the semicircle is 7&nbsp;cm.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Calculate the total area of the shape. Give your answer correct to 3 significant figures.",
     "ans": "Area =",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 3
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "103 or 103.2&hellip;",
     "3",
     "M1 for 12 &times; 7 (= 84)<br>M1 for <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>2</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 3.5<sup>2</sup> (= 19.24&hellip;) oe<br>A1"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Split the shape into a rectangle and a semicircle.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Area of the rectangle = 12 &times; 7 = 84 cm<sup>2</sup>",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "The diameter of the semicircle is 7 cm, so its radius is 3.5 cm.",
      "radius = diameter &divide; 2"
     ],
     [
      "Area of the semicircle = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>2</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 3.5<sup>2</sup> = 19.2422&hellip; cm<sup>2</sup>",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Total = 84 + 19.2422&hellip; = 103.2422&hellip;",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Area = <b>103 cm<sup>2</sup></b> (3 s.f.)",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
