   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows a solid cone with radius 5&nbsp;cm and slant height 13&nbsp;cm.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Show that the perpendicular height of the cone is 12&nbsp;cm.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate the volume of the cone. Give your answer correct to 3 significant figures.<br>[The volume, <i>V</i>, of a cone with radius <i>r</i> and height <i>h</i> is <i>V</i> = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>2</sup><i>h</i>.]",
     "ans": "",
     "unit": "cm<sup>3</sup>",
     "m": 2
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "",
     "2",
     "M1 for <i>h</i><sup>2</sup> = 13<sup>2</sup> &minus; 5<sup>2</sup> (= 169 &minus; 25) oe<br>A1 for &radic;144 = 12, nfww"
    ],
    [
     "314 or 314.1&hellip;",
     "2",
     "M1 for <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 5<sup>2</sup> &times; 12 oe<br>A1 (exact 100&pi;)"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "The radius, the perpendicular height and the slant height form a right-angled triangle, with the slant height as the hypotenuse.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>h</i><sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup> = 13<sup>2</sup>",
      "Pythagoras' theorem"
     ],
     [
      "<i>h</i><sup>2</sup> = 169 &minus; 25 = 144",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>h</i> = &radic;144 = <b>12 cm</b> as required.",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "<i>V</i> = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>2</sup><i>h</i> = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 5<sup>2</sup> &times; 12",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "= <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 300 = 100&pi; = 314.159&hellip;",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Volume = <b>314 cm<sup>3</sup></b> (3 s.f.)",
      ""
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "marks": 4,
   "svg": null,
   "stem": "<p>A solid hemisphere has radius 6&nbsp;cm.<br>[The volume, <i>V</i>, of a sphere with radius <i>r</i> is <i>V</i> = <sup>4</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>3</sup>.]<br>[The surface area, <i>A</i>, of a sphere with radius <i>r</i> is <i>A</i> = 4&pi;<i>r</i><sup>2</sup>.]</p>",
   "parts": [
