     "452 or 452.3&hellip;",
     "2",
     "M1 for <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>2</sub> &times; <sup>4</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 6<sup>3</sup> oe<br>A1 (exact 144&pi;)"
    ],
    [
     "339 or 339.2&hellip;",
     "2",
     "M1 for 2&pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> + &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> oe<br>A1 (exact 108&pi;)<br>M0 if the flat circular face is omitted"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "A hemisphere is half a sphere, so halve the sphere formula.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>V</i> = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>2</sub> &times; <sup>4</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 6<sup>3</sup> = <sup>2</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub> &times; &pi; &times; 216",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "= 144&pi; = 452.389&hellip;",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Volume = <b>452 cm<sup>3</sup></b> (3 s.f.)",
      ""
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "The surface is made of a curved part and a flat circular face.",
      "&quot;total surface area&quot; includes the flat face"
     ],
     [
      "Curved surface = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>2</sub> &times; 4&pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> = 2&pi; &times; 36 = 72&pi;",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Flat circle = &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> = 36&pi;",
      ""
     ],
     [
