   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows a solid prism of length 15&nbsp;cm.<br>The cross-section is a right-angled triangle with the two shorter sides 6&nbsp;cm and 8&nbsp;cm.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Calculate the volume of the prism.",
     "ans": "Volume =",
     "unit": "cm<sup>3</sup>",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate the total surface area of the prism.",
     "ans": "Area =",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 2
