   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows a solid made from a cylinder of radius 7&nbsp;cm and height 20&nbsp;cm with a hemisphere of radius 7&nbsp;cm on top.<br>[The volume, <i>V</i>, of a sphere with radius <i>r</i> is <i>V</i> = <sup>4</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>3</sup>.]</p>",
