   "stem": "<p>A solid metal cone has radius 6&nbsp;cm and perpendicular height 15&nbsp;cm.<br>The cone is melted down and the metal is used to make solid spheres of radius 1.6&nbsp;cm.<br>[The volume, <i>V</i>, of a cone with radius <i>r</i> and height <i>h</i> is <i>V</i> = <sup>1</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>2</sup><i>h</i>.]<br>[The volume, <i>V</i>, of a sphere with radius <i>r</i> is <i>V</i> = <sup>4</sup>\u2044<sub>3</sub>&pi;<i>r</i><sup>3</sup>.]</p>",
